    },
    {
      "id": "b-123",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### Putting It All Together"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-124",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A **cinematographer’s CV** alone usually takes the form of a **credit list + awards + short bio**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-125",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For a **website**, you’ll likely want that data **plus** a visually engaging **portfolio/reel** and **stills** that show off the cinematographer’s style."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Make sure you gather **admin/domain access** and brand assets early on, so you can connect everything smoothly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "By combining a succinct, professionally formatted CV with **visually compelling** reels, project stills, and awards, you’ll be able to **showcase** his work in a way that’s both **comprehensive** and **appealing** to prospective collaborators."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **REQUEST FOR DELIVERABLES**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a **concise, modular set of deliverables** you can send to your client prior to kickoff. Feel free to shuffle or piece these sections together in your final SOW."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-130",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
