      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Full-Length Reel** to embed or link to after button click."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- *Note*: If any footage is missing, let me know—we can **scrape MP4s from YouTube** (with your permission) to fill gaps."
