      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## **IV. Quick Thoughts on Reel Strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Landing Page Teaser**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A short, attention-grabbing cut (fast-paced, 20–30 seconds)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Autoplay as a full-screen background or hero element for a strong first impression."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A **“Watch Full Reel”** button to lead viewers to the in-depth version."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Full Reel**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-174",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Let the cinematic work breathe—include longer scenes or transitions that show range and versatility."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Could be embedded on a dedicated page or displayed in a modal pop-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*(We don’t have to finalize the reel approach right now—just gather enough footage so we can experiment.)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-177",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **Next Steps**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Please gather these materials in a shared folder or send them my way."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We’ll schedule a mini-strategy session (optional) to clarify how to weave your 20-year story into a compelling, cohesive website narrative."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Once I have the assets, we can finalize layout ideas, brand style, and how best to spotlight your experience among a younger, more tech-centric filmmaking crowd."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
