    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Feel free to edit any part of this list to fit your tone or preferences. We’ll puzzle-piece the final details into the SOW for a smooth, jazz-like flow of creativity and efficiency."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-184",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **SEO / SOCIAL MEDIA**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Below is a **draft section** you can include in your proposal or SOW, explaining the **value and structure** of a fully managed social media service—tailored to a cinematographer with 20+ years of experience and minimal online presence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "## **Social Media Management (Optional Add-On)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **1. Why Social Media Matters for a Veteran Cinematographer**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Build Credibility & Reach**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-190",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Even a simple Instagram feed or LinkedIn profile can become a quick “lookbook” for potential collaborators. It reinforces your online presence beyond just a standalone site or IMDb page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Strengthen SEO**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Search engines give credence to cross-linked, active social profiles. Sharing new reels or behind-the-scenes posts can drive traffic back to your site, improving search visibility."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Showcase Personality & Experience**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "After two decades in the industry, your behind-the-scenes stories, set photos, or quick insights can spark interest. Social media offers a channel to reveal the “real person” behind the camera."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-195",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **2. Fully-Managed Approach**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-196",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Profile Setup & Branding**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-197",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We’ll create or optimize your accounts (e.g., Instagram, LinkedIn, Vimeo/YouTube) with a consistent visual brand, bio, and contact info."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-198",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- All credentials and ownership stay with you—our role is to maintain and update them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-199",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Content Calendar & Strategy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-200",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We’ll plan monthly or weekly posts highlighting key credits, short reel snippets, and on-set anecdotes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-201",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- This calendar is shared with you for approvals or edits, so you’re always comfortable with what’s being published."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-202",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Content Creation & Curation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-203",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We pull from your existing footage, stills, or new “quick tips” to craft engaging posts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-204",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Where needed, we’ll design graphics or create short, social-friendly teasers from your reel footage."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-205",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Engagement & Audience Growth**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-206",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We respond to basic inquiries or DMs, keeping you in the loop if deeper conversations arise."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-207",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We can strategically follow or interact with relevant film accounts, festivals, or production studios to grow your network."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-208",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Analytics & Reporting**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-209",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Track followers, engagement rates, and clicks back to your website."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-210",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Provide monthly recaps so you can see which content resonates and refine strategies accordingly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-211",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **3. Tailored to 20+ Years of Industry Experience**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-212",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Highlight Classic Techniques**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-213",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Share short posts or reels that demonstrate “tried-and-true” cinematography methods versus newer experimental trends."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-214",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- E.g., a mini-breakdown of how you overcame a challenging lighting setup using time-tested approaches."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-215",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Behind-the-Scenes Nuggets**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-216",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "With such a lengthy career, you have anecdotes from set mishaps to surprising improvisations—these can be turned into quick, impactful posts that illustrate your reliability and depth of knowledge."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-217",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Selective Engagement**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-218",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If you prefer minimal interaction, we can keep it purely as a professional portfolio feed rather than a day-to-day personal presence. You can set the tone and level of direct interaction."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-219",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **4. Proposed Deliverables**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-220",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Account Creation/Optimization** (Instagram, LinkedIn, Vimeo/YouTube, etc.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-221",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Monthly Content Calendar** (2–4 posts/week, depending on your preference)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-222",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Content Design & Scheduling** (carousels, short videos, still frames)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-223",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Community Management** (light engagement, DM triage, comment monitoring)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-224",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Monthly Analytics Report** (growth, top-performing posts, next steps)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-225",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "### **5. Next Steps If Interested**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-226",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We’ll hold a brief “Social Brainstorm” call to define your comfort level, content themes, and brand voice."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-227",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Decide which platforms align best with your goals (Instagram for visuals, LinkedIn for networking, Vimeo/YouTube for reel hosting)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-228",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Once approved, we’ll integrate this service into your monthly subscription or retainer for ongoing management."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-230",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**In short**, a managed social media presence complements your site’s SEO efforts and showcases the depth of your experience—without adding to your workload. It’s an effective way to stay on the radar of directors, producers, and industry peers who might otherwise never stumble upon your website."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-231",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Braindump"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We must povide a list of these deliverables in a concise comprehensive format that I can send to him prior to kickoff. It will be included in the SOW"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Please note in the list that I can scrape together any missing video assets by downloading mp4s from youtube if neccessary. Also, please include the reel that will be housed on the landing page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We discussed quite a bit about what the reel should include... we want it to be a strong first impression showcasing the most valuable content up front with fast cuts to retain attention, and a button to view the full reel. Maybe we show a shorter version of the reel as a fullcsreen background element, then embed the full length reel on button click? This doesn't have to be figured out just yet, I'm only thinking out loud."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We also discussed the best ways we can illustrate his key differentiators (experience, breadth of skills/knowledge, and process <will add more>)–What do you reckon I will need from him in order to best approach this open question? What kinds of things will I need to know from him in order to have the information I need to properly discern the best way to illustrate his value? Based on our discussion, his 20 years of experience in the industry and impressive resume are the meat & potatoes. We were considering desining his site with somewhat of a lo-fi old-school type vibe in order to subtley illustrate his tenure, especially in comparison to younger folks in the same field. He mentioned that the younger folks tend to get turned away because they are too experimental or rely on un-tried tech like AI and other things. This is an interesting problem to me cuz he's really competing against this new wave of filmmakers who (in my opinion) aren't bringing the same level of live blood to the art. Some language and strategy around this complex issue would be most helpful."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Questions to Ask:"
        }
      ]
    },
